{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Ds5f90yOqmIbhAraOCxCSg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:23.147937+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Ds5f90yOqmIbhAraOCxCSg","html":"<div><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一、</span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>医院简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院是一所集医疗、科研、教学、预防与保健为一体并跨省区服务的省级肿瘤防治研究中心，是肿瘤学、普外科和乳腺外科国家临床重点专科建设单位、国家疑难病症诊治能力提升工程项目入选单位、国家药物临床试验机构、中国临床肿瘤学会（国家一级学会）理事长单位、中华医学会放疗分会主委单位、山东省临床医学中心，为山东省癌症中心、山东省肿瘤质控中心、山东省抗癌协会、山东省临床肿瘤学会和山东省肿瘤防办挂靠单位。</span></span></p><p><span><span>医院师资队伍实力雄厚，现有中国工程院院士、国家万人计划专家、长江学者奖励计划专家等国家级人才</span><span><span>14</span></span><span>人，泰山学者、省杰青、省优青等省部级人才</span><span><span>107</span></span><span>人。其中放疗团队成功入选第四批“全国高校黄大年式教师团队”，获省级教学成果特等奖和省级教学名师等多项荣誉。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>作为临床医学一级学科博、硕士生培养单位，是</span></span><span><span><span>国内</span></span><span>17</span></span><span><span>所高校临床医学博士生带教点，</span></span><span><span><span>同时也是国内</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>所高校的公共卫生、计算机技术、核科学等一级学科博士生带教点，拥有博硕士生导师</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span>56</span><span><span>人，年招收博、硕士生</span></span><span>180</span><span><span>余人。不断加强国内外交流合作，与美国</span></span><span><span>M</span></span><span>.D. Anderson</span></span><span><span>癌症中心、德国海德堡大学、香港理工大学等国际一流院校机构签署合作备忘录，每年选派多名优秀学生出国交流和学习。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>近十几年间，医院获得国家和省部级科技奖</span><span><span>40</span></span><span>余项，其中为首获得国家科技进步二等奖</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>项、何梁何利科学与技术进步奖</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>项、山东省科学技术最高奖</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>项、省部一等奖</span><span><span>8</span></span><span>项；近年来承担国家级课题</span><span><span>150</span></span><span>余项，六次获国家科技重大（重点）专项；两次荣获美国</span><span><span>ASTRO</span></span><span>大会唯一“国际优秀论文奖”；近三年平均每年发表</span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span>论文数近</span><span><span>300</span></span><span>篇。投入近亿元购置小动物</span><span><span>MRI</span></span><span>、小动物</span><span><span>PET-CT</span></span><span>和小动物精准辐照仪等高端基础研究设备，搭建放射免疫、分子影像、人工智能和公共平台等国际一流的平台。拥有质子放射治疗系统、磁共振引导加速器、射波刀、</span><span><span>TOMO</span></span><span>等一批代表国际先进水平的图像引导高端放疗设备，是目前国内放疗设备最多、最先进、诊疗人次最多的医院。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><strong><span>夏令营简介</span></strong></span></strong><strong></strong></span><strong></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>为进一步促进医学、生命科学等专业优秀大学生和山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院各科室及导师之间的相互了解和交流，促进不同高校间的交流和优秀人才的选拔深造，我院将举办2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动。活动期间，营员将会近距离了解肿瘤医院的优势学科，提前体验临床教学情况，医院将举办学术讲座、导师见面会、优秀研究生及青年学者交流会等多种活动。本届夏令营表现突出者，将获得“山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院暑期夏令营优秀营员”称号。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>三、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生人数</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>夏令营活动招生规模为30人，最终人数将视报名情况适当调整，择优录取。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>四、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>组织形式</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>本年度夏令营活动，初步定为线下方式。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>五、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好、遵纪守法、诚实守信，身心健康且有志于在相关专业领域提升自身科学研究和实践能力的2027届全日制本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 英语水平优秀。满足以下之一：CET6≥425分或CET4≥500分；或托福85分及以上；或雅思6.0以上。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 学习成绩排名前列，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格；或有志参加山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院研究生招生考试的学生（原则上本科阶段的学业成绩排名在本专业前30%）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. 对所报考专业或相关创新性科研工作有浓厚兴趣。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>六、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><strong><span><span>报名时间及流程</span></span></strong></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）报名时间</span></span></p><p><span><span>报名时间为2026年7月7日—7月27日。活动举办期间，将全面介绍我院情况及研究生教育的情况、实验室及科研平台、招生政策、优势学科团队、导师队伍等，根据学生需求参观院内优势专业、实验室平台、质子中心，举办名师交流等活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）报名流程</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.登录山东第一医科大学研究生报考服务系统（网址：https://yjszs.sdfmu.edu.cn/），按要求完成报名信息填写。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.提交材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）学生证、身份证扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）个人电子照片：近期拍摄正面免冠彩色照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）夏令营申请表（需签字盖章，上传扫描件）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）本科成绩单（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）英语成绩证明：英语四级、六级成绩单、TOEFL成绩、雅思成绩、GRE成绩等证明材料扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）科研成果相关证明材料：申请人可提交体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果及获奖证书。无科研成果者可不提交本项材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.请将上述材料上传系统的同时，将扫描件合并成一个PDF文档，文件命名格式：姓名+夏令营材料，并将该PDF作为附件发送至邮箱：sdzljyk811@126.com。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>七、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><strong><span><span>资格审核</span></span></strong></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>医院以教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质为主要评价依据，对申请者进行资格评审。入营合格者名单将于7月下旬-8月上旬在山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院官网公布，并以电子邮件或电话形式通知大家。未收到入营通知皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span><span><span>八、</span></span></span></span></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><strong><span><span>相关事项说明</span></span></strong></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.夏令营活动方式和具体活动日程请及时关注我院夏令营的通知，并按要求提交材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本夏令营属于非盈利性质的文化交流活动，不收取任何费用。我院不承担参加者活动期间所产生的任何法律和经济责任。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.夏令营参加者应自觉遵守夏令营期间的各项规定和要求，遵从工作人员的统一安排，不得从事与夏令营无关的任何活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎优秀本科生踊跃报名参加。这个夏天期待与你们相遇！</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：路老师 郑老师 王老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：0531-67626506</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>供稿：</span><span><span><span>教学管理部</span></span></span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>编辑：李鹏飞</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>责编：王沙沙</span></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>审核：路友华</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8tZda9jKh6k7EYXRg2gnYnqo8lUcdGqXtj9zIjdziaNz6vNWkO9r4Iuic6fO2B2l2gaGrMynZUiadYl723WtZYLUg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ee54f0c697b7752ae8fa4c40de35820923c4aae2ea55d5990e369e10b2c155f7","textLength":2232,"sourceSha256":"4f6dc89669265ed84e577238e8f9a5cdf95bf9f0e5ee24264ceeed67af498bb6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8f241bf72a2f73b4d593","title":"2026年山东第一医科大学附属肿瘤医院2026年优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:23.147937+00:00"}
